    "toc": [
      {
        "number": "1",
        "title": "SAPIR: Scalable and Dis",
        "page": "",
        "level": 1
      },
      {
        "number": "1.1",
        "title": "Abstract—In this paper we present a scalable and distributed",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.2",
        "title": "system for image retrieval based on visual features and annotated",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.3",
        "title": "text. This system is the core of the SAPIR project. Its architecture",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.4",
        "title": "makes use of Peer-to-Peer networks to achieve scalability and",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.5",
        "title": "efficiency allowing the management of huge amount of data.",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.6",
        "title": "For the presented demo we use 10 million images and accom-",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.7",
        "title": "panying text (tags, comments, etc.) taken from Flickr. Through",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.8",
        "title": "the web interface it is possible to efficient perform content-",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.9",
        "title": "based similarity search, as well as traditional text search on the",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.10",
        "title": "metadata annotated by the Flickr community. Fast complex query",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.11",
        "title": "processing is also possible combining visual features and text.",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.12",
        "title": "We show that the combination of content-based and text search",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.13",
        "title": "on a large scale can dramatically improve the capability of a",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.14",
        "title": "multimedia search system to answer the users needs and that",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.15",
        "title": "the Peer-to-Peer based architecture can cope with the scalability",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.16",
        "title": "issues (response time obtained for this demo over 10 million",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.17",
        "title": "images is always below 500 milliseconds).",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.18",
        "title": "Index Terms—Peer-to-Peer, metric spaces, distributed, scala-",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "1.19",
        "title": "bility, MPEG-7, similarity search.",
        "page": "",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "number": "2",
        "title": "tributed Image Searching",
        "page": "",
        "level": 1
      }
    ],
